        "Absence of granulomatous inflammation",
        "Negative NOD2 mutation",
        "Different uveitis pattern"
      ]
    },
    {
      "diseaseId": "sarcoidosis",
      "distinguishingFeatures": [
        "Usually adult onset",
        "Pulmonary involvement more prominent",
        "No familial inheritance pattern"
      ]
    }
  ],
